        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Colorful “perler beads”, also called “pindou” in Chinese, are becoming popular across the country. People use tiny "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "plastic",
            "ref": "v-plastic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " beads to make animals, flowers, cartoon characters, and even famous buildings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "According to a report by "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "New Hunan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "orders",
            "zh": "订单"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for perler bead group activities during the 2026 Spring Festival "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "rose",
            "zh": "上升"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by more than 9000% compared with last year. Many handcraft "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "stores",
            "zh": "手工商店"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " are now full of young "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "customers",
            "ref": "v-customer"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“I made a panda with my friends, and it was so "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "relaxing",
            "zh": "令人放松的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” said 10-year-old Lily from Shanghai. “I want to make more next time.” Some parents also enjoy the activity because it helps children become more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "patient",
            "ref": "v-patient"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and creative."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "People often share their works online, making the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trend",
            "zh": "潮流"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " spread even faster. Many students say they enjoy turning small beads into colorful art."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Experts "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "remind",
            "zh": "提醒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " families to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "choose",
            "ref": "v-choose"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " safe and high-quality products. Cheap beads may have strong "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "smells",
            "ref": "v-smell"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or unsafe "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "materials",
            "zh": "材料"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", so children should use them with adult "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "guidance",
            "zh": "成年人指导"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
